  "project": {
    "id": "59fe608d-da66-4428-9271-3a1b7ff08e61",
    "name": "MedexRegAI",
    "description": "MedexRegAI helps 510(k) consultants turn the files clients send (test reports, protocols, raw data, specifications and drawings in Word, Excel, PowerPoint and PDF) into eSTAR-ready submission sections. It connects read-only to the folders firms already use (Dropbox, Box, SharePoint/OneDrive, Google Drive), sorts each file into an eSTAR section, and flags gaps and contradictions. It then drafts sections in Word, where every statement cites a source page and the consultant reviews and approves it. It does not replace the firm's eQMS or other systems. The consultant files and signs; MedexRegAI never does."
  },
